<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Select Polylines by Number of Nodes</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Select &gt; Polylines &gt; By Number of Nodes</b></span>.</p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Select Polylines by Number of Nodes</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command selects all visible polylines in the scene, which number of vertices (nodes) is less than the value set in the dialog.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="Images/select_polylines.gif" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">&#160;</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If a polyline fits the conditions, it will be selected entirely. Default value is 3 vertices.</span></p>
<p class="Note"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">that</span> <span class="Command">Select Polylines by Number of Nodes</span> <span lang="EN-GB">removes any previous polyline selections. Other data types remain unaffected.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP1046080814" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="Commands_files/image313.jpg" width="527px" height="332px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">this command to select (and later remove) short polylines created from cross sections.</span></p>
